1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,890
(Howard:)Women, huh?

2
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:03,420
(Howard:)Can't live with them,

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,840
(Howard:)can't successfully
refute their hypotheses.

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,010
(Sheldon:)Amen to that.

5
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:16,700
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon.

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,340
(Amy:)Hello.

7
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,090
(Penny:)I hear you broke up with Amy.

8
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:26,510
(Sheldon:)A breakup would imply
she was my girlfriend.

9
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,130
(Sheldon:)She was a girl who was my friend

10
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:31,570
(Sheldon:)who is now a girl who
is not my friend.

11
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:35,150
(Penny:)Wow. That's like the
worst country song ever.

12
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:39,640
(Penny:)So, how are you doing?

13
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,910
(Sheldon:)Regarding what?

14
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,040
(Sheldon:)Amy.

15
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:44,140
(Sheldon:)I don't follow.

16
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:49,370
(Penny:)Well, breakups-- or whatever the
hell this is-- can be tough.

17
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:51,370
(Sheldon:)Penny, I assure you, I'm fine.

18
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:54,540
(Sheldon:)My relationship with Amy
was purely intellectual,

19
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,990
(Sheldon:)There were no emotional bonds,

